This project includes third-party dependencies with their own licenses:

| Dependency | License | Notes |
|------------|---------|-------|
| FastAPI | MIT | Backend framework |
| Uvicorn | MIT | ASGI server |
| SQLAlchemy | MIT | ORM library |
| PostgreSQL | PostgreSQL License | Database engine |
| WeasyPrint | BSD-style | PDF rendering engine |
| OpenAI SDK | Apache 2.0 / MIT | HTTP client for AI calls |
| pydyf | Unknown | Used with WeasyPrint (pinned to 0.11.0) |
| pdfplumber | BSD | PDF parsing |
| Tailwind CSS | MIT | Frontend styling |

